taset.\n\nThe median of the new dataset is {{field-2}} the median of the original dataset." 13194139540373 17592186576411 false] [17592186217487 1071 "The frequency table below shows the number of values in a dataset that fall into each group.\nRounded to one decimal place, what is the largest possible value of the mean?\n\n\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Value $(x)$</th>\n<th data-cell-align=\"center\" data-fill=\"#D6EAF8\">Frequency $(f)$</th>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$30 - 32$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$3$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$32 - 34$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$4$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$34 - 36$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$2$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-next-row=\"true\">\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$36 - 38$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$5$</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$38 - 40$</td>\n<td data-cell-align=\"center\">$1$</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question." 13194139540373 17592186576411 true] [17592186217487 1071 "The frequency table below shows the number of values in a dataset that fall into each group.\nRounded to one decimal place, what is the largest possible value of the mean?\n\n| Value $(x)$ | Frequency $(f)$ |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $30 - 32$ | $3$ |\n| $32 - 34$ | $4$ |\n| $34 - 36$ | $2$ |\n| $36 - 38$ | $5$ |\n| $38 - 40$ | $1$ |\n\n> A calculator is required to answer this question." 13194139540373 17592186576411 false] [17592186217489 1071 "\n\n<div class=\"source-table-scroll\"><table class=\"source-table\" data-rules=\"all\" data-table-align=\"center\" data-frame=\"true\">\n<tbody><tr data-next-row=\"t